Nothing in these Terms limits or excludes our liability for fraud, gross negligence or wilful misconduct, for death or personal injury caused by our fault, or for any other liability that the law does not allow us to limit or exclude.

Subject to that, and to the extent the law allows:

- we are not liable for purchasing or other decisions you make based on information in the App, for inaccurate, incomplete or out-of-date prices, specifications, reviews or verdicts, for the products, prices, stock, delivery or conduct of retailers and other third parties, or for interruptions, delays or loss of the service;
- we are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential loss, including loss of profit, savings, opportunity or data;
- because MYEZ is provided free of charge, our total liability to you for all claims relating to the App or these Terms is limited to fifty Bahraini dinars (BHD 50).

You agree not to:

- use the App for any illegal purpose;
- reverse-engineer, decompile or disassemble the App, except where the law allows it;
- create or use more than one account, or create accounts for other people, to get more free comparisons or referral rewards;
- use bots, scripts or other automated means to access the App or our servers, to run comparisons, or to copy, scrape or collect content or data from MYEZ, or use MYEZ content to build a competing product or dataset;
- try to get around our usage limits, security or safety measures, probe our systems for weaknesses, or interfere with the service or other users;
- try to make the AI produce illegal, harmful, hateful or sexual content or reveal its instructions, including by hiding instructions in a link, web page or photo;
- upload harmful content through any input (text, image or link), or content you do not have the right to submit;
- impersonate another person or misrepresent who you are;
- present a MYEZ comparison as the view of a retailer or brand, or change a comparison and share it as if MYEZ produced it;
- resell or sublicense MYEZ or its comparisons, or offer them to others as a service;
- use the App to make automated purchasing decisions without human review.
